### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 17, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-11-24 for Two (2) Trucks for the City of Cheyenne, Weed
& Pest Division
 ______________________________________________
Bid #E-11-24 was originally solicited for Six (6) Trucks for the City of Cheyenne (Mid-Size, 1
Ton, Cab & Chassis).  This Consideration of Bid was approved on April 8, 2024.

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received
from:
1. Ken Garff Cheyenne
2. Fremont Motor Company – Submitted ‘No Bid’

The City of Cheyenne Weed & Pest Division has requested an additional two (2) trucks to be
ordered, from the previous bid solicitation.

Ken Garff has agreed to honor their previously submitted price from the original bid submission.

The total requested additional bid award is for $86,514.00 for the purchase of two (2) additional
trucks.

Funding:
Weed & Pest:  $86,514.00
010-17-1702-44-43102 (Weed & Pest / Equipment (over $5,000))
```

